Owner: factC. Date 2026-10-17. Evidence, proofs and reproduction commands are in `notes/trackC_analysis.md`. Throughout, `L = B − A`, `p` is the least prime factor, and `Z_L = {0, −1, …, −(L−1)} mod p`.

