- **M5:** the discriminant unit predicate is correct with roots \(0,\ldots,K-1\). The displayed cross-resultant evaluation can differ by a sign, irrelevant after squaring. The \(\widetilde O(K)\) cost describes the proposed evaluator, not a lower bound against all evaluators.

